{"id":471402,"imdb":"tt6182954","en":"The Treasure: Truth & Imagination","orig":"الكنز: الحقيقة والخيال","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"في عام 1975، يقرر (حسن بشر) العودة من أوروبا بعد دراسته لعلوم المصريات إلى منزل العائلة في اﻷقصر، ويكتشف أن والده (بشر الكتاتني) ترك له وصية مسجلة، كما ترك له برديات تعود لفترة حكم الملكة (حتشبسوت)، ومذكرات مكتوبة بخط اليد ومنسوبة للبطل (علي الزيبق)، وعلى (حسن) البحث عما يربط كل هذا ببعضه.","rd":"2017-08-31","rt":157,"g":[28,18,12,10749],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"United Bros. Studios","logo":"/rV3en6jMB6cAWNggmi7RBUVAEsV.png","c":"EG"}],"countries":["EG"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":"The Treasure","rel":[{"c":"EG","d":"2017-08-31"}],"dir":["Sherif Arafa"],"prod":["Walid Sabri"],"wri":["Sherif Arafa","Abdul Rahim Kamal"],"mus":["Hesham Nazih"],"dop":["Ayman Abu Makarem"],"cast":[{"n":"Mohamed Saad","ch":"","p":"/zpIK3GYmqDPumneEDf0aqsqxhV1.jpg"},{"n":"Hend Sabry","ch":"","p":"/o8Cn0nzoUpsA6d8dORsZJWGVTCB.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Ramadan","ch":"","p":"/2UlMUlVJqW59dvXQ0NOQPPnlPWc.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Rizq","ch":"","p":"/st0gdwDQQ6SuVjdR6YzebQ4rmEg.jpg"},{"n":"Amina Khalil","ch":"","p":"/eHJBpaypMN52VSIF84r5MgvC0Mr.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Hatem","ch":"","p":"/r0flzTKg5jI8JlzVqvM5m32QGkU.jpg"},{"n":"Haitham Ahmed Zaki","ch":"","p":"/8WU3lIINiGglNxLFloXYKNu8jbv.jpg"},{"n":"Sawsan Badr","ch":"","p":"/yHgnipZ0bDUjjdf1Pu9S7bEhcun.jpg"},{"n":"Ruby","ch":"","p":"/oHnmUfGuJuNdS2QcoZlKUZwfHAi.jpg"},{"n":"Hani Adel","ch":"","p":"/zXqqM0ZbK5fcWD9d1VpqLtkx4sZ.jpg"},{"n":"Abbas Abu Elhassan","ch":"","p":"/wXbXtPndb6EAaIaOBbDweMufjBD.jpg"},{"n":"Mohey Ismail","ch":"","p":"/ksDFx6rj2p6SRvBgxJXTZ1UYAsy.jpg"},{"n":"Abdelaziz Makhyoun","ch":"","p":"/bNVEnr8LO2MzDL0XrYVp1GyvTnO.jpg"},{"n":"Gamil Barsoum","ch":"","p":"/cWGdhU31qxhEccoiymzyLnTfxNC.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Amin","ch":"","p":"/b22RdCDUrUEmD1g8X1gkHqF9q1U.jpg"},{"n":"Ramzy Lehner","ch":"","p":"/l5VdBQRYvxS6DNe29iQt0zJ3HJx.jpg"}]}